{"marking": "<section class=\"page\" data-page=\"marking\"><div class=\"crumb\"><div class=\"wrap\"><button class=\"back\" data-back=\"home\">&#8592; Back<span class=\"bn\"> to Resources</span></button><span class=\"csep\"></span><button data-go=\"home\">Resources</button><span class=\"sep\">›</span><span>Mission Marking</span></div></div><div class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-h\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Browse</div><h2>Mission Marking</h2><p>One branch among eight — but the one that closes the loop. A child reads a feature, does the mission, gets marked, and rises.</p></div><div class=\"campgrid\" data-tools><button class=\"campcard\" data-src=\"/new/missions/print\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"--c:var(--navy)\"><span class=\"cc-emb\"><svg class=\"emb\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 9V3h12v6\"/><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"/><path d=\"M6 14h12v7H6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"cc-body\"><span class=\"cc-name\">Print</span><span class=\"cc-desc\">Mission sheets, ready to hand out.</span></span></button><button class=\"campcard\" data-src=\"/new/missions/mark\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"--c:var(--blue)\"><span class=\"cc-emb\"><svg class=\"emb\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"/><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"/></svg></span><span class=\"cc-body\"><span class=\"cc-name\">Mark</span><span class=\"cc-desc\">The grid where the platoon gets marked.</span></span></button><button class=\"campcard\" data-src=\"/new/missions/personalize\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"--c:var(--purple)\"><span class=\"cc-emb\"><svg class=\"emb\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"